            <p>AT-HOME SCALP MICRONEEDLING SYSTEM</p>
            <h1>Qure Micro-Infusion Pro&nbsp;Hair&nbsp;System</h1>
            <article>
                <ul class="collapsed-list">
                    <li>
                        <span><strong>Visibly fuller, denser-looking hair</strong> with consistent use</span>
