            <p>You’ve probably tried the serums, the topicals everyone swore by. Most of them can only work from the surface. <em>Micro-Infusion Pro does a different job.</em> <br />It stamps straight down onto your scalp, so there’s no rolling or dragging through your hair. Its tiny 0.5mm gold-plated microneedles create channels in the scalp, so the serum goes where your hair grows and not just onto the strands. <br /><em>Part your hair, press, lift, move on. Five minutes, once a week.</em></p>
        </article>
